{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#card-zh","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"2D Model Picker 是 DSH 网页端插件，用二维网格选择模型和推理强度。它接管对话输入区的原生模型选择位置，把模型放在行、推理档位放在列，并以可拖动的滑点呈现有效组合。用户可以拖动或用键盘移动选择点，确认后将模型与推理强度写入当前会话；界面会显示当前选择，并处理会话锁定和提交错误。适合希望快速比较并切换模型及推理档位的 DSH 网页用户。通过 DSH 插件安装即可使用，不需要额外配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:18-28","client.js:326-369","client.js:480-497","client.js:767-779"]}
{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#card-en","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"2D Model Picker is a DSH web plugin that replaces the conversation model selector with a grid of models and reasoning tiers. Drag the puck or use arrow keys to choose a supported combination for the current session. It displays selection errors. Install through DSH plugins; no extra setup is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:18-28","client.js:326-369","client.js:480-497","client.js:767-779"]}
