{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#feature-1","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"2D Model Picker 的功能「二维模型与推理档位网格」：在对话输入区打开选择面板，行表示模型、列表示推理强度，并只允许选择该模型支持的组合。拖动滑点即可预览并提交选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:266-297","client.js:441-478"]}
{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#feature-2","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"2D Model Picker 的功能「更新当前模型目录」：界面向 DSH 会话服务读取模型目录，并在适配器更新或连接重置时重新加载。可用模型及其推理档位来自会话数据。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:128-147"]}
{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#feature-3","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"2D Model Picker 的功能「键盘选择模型组合」：焦点位于网格时，可用方向键移动到有效组合，再按 Enter 或空格提交当前预览选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:480-497"]}
{"unit_id":"Fyerl__dsh-2d-model-picker#feature-4","repo":"Fyerl/dsh-2d-model-picker","commit":"53227d337838a061284aadccfaf4c794fc2f775d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"2D Model Picker 的功能「反馈会话切换状态」：选择提交期间显示忙碌状态；服务返回错误或调用异常时，在面板中呈现可读提示，成功后根据会话投影更新当前选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:326-369","client.js:519-525"]}
